  abilityName: Holy Spectrum Welfreizer
  abilityDesc: 18 combo massive Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), adds high probability of resistance against 1 KO attack, enormously boosts
    Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns, enormously boosts critical hit rate and OD gauge fill
    rate for 3 turns, enormous damage reduction from all types for 3 turns & enormously
    boosts BB gauge for 3 turns
